### Execute GraphQL Query
POST https://localhost:5001/api/adapters/graphql/extract
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "url": "https://api.github.com/graphql",
  "method": "POST",
  "headers": {
    "Authorization": "Bearer YOUR_GITHUB_TOKEN"
  },
  "body": {
    "query": "query { viewer { login name email } }"
  }
}

###

### GraphQL with Variables
POST https://localhost:5001/api/adapters/graphql/extract
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "url": "https://api.github.com/graphql",
  "method": "POST",
  "headers": {
    "Authorization": "Bearer YOUR_GITHUB_TOKEN"
  },
  "body": {
    "query": "query GetRepository($owner: String!, $name: String!) { repository(owner: $owner, name: $name) { name description stargazerCount forkCount } }",
    "variables": {
      "owner": "microsoft",
      "name": "playwright"
    }
  }
}

###

### GraphQL Mutation
POST https://localhost:5001/api/adapters/graphql/extract
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "url": "https://api.github.com/graphql",
  "method": "POST",
  "headers": {
    "Authorization": "Bearer YOUR_GITHUB_TOKEN"
  },
  "body": {
    "query": "mutation AddStar($starrableId: ID!) { addStar(input: {starrableId: $starrableId}) { starrable { stargazerCount } } }",
    "variables": {
      "starrableId": "REPOSITORY_ID"
    }
  }
}

###

### Complex Nested Query
POST https://localhost:5001/api/adapters/graphql/extract
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "url": "https://api.github.com/graphql",
  "method": "POST",
  "headers": {
    "Authorization": "Bearer YOUR_GITHUB_TOKEN"
  },
  "body": {
    "query": "query GetUserRepositories($login: String!, $first: Int!) { user(login: $login) { repositories(first: $first, orderBy: {field: STARGAZERS, direction: DESC}) { edges { node { name description stargazerCount languages(first: 3) { edges { node { name } } } } } } } }",
    "variables": {
      "login": "torvalds",
      "first": 10
    },
    "operationName": "GetUserRepositories"
  }
}

###
